{
  "name": "Email Inbox Triage & Summarization",
  "description": "Automatically summarize and prioritize your unread emails to identify the most important messages requiring attention. Perfect for busy professionals managing high email volumes.",
  "tags": [
    "gmail",
    "lead-generation",
    "sales",
    "ai",
    "summarization",
    "triage",
    "productivity"
  ],
  "customization_guide": "Adjust email_count to control how many unread emails to check (default: 10). Modify top_count to change how many priority emails to highlight (default: 3). Customize the classification criteria in the LLM prompt to match your priorities (e.g., client emails, urgent keywords).",
  "spec": {
    "version": "2",
    "triggers": [],
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "fetch_unread_emails",
        "type": "tool",
        "tool": "gmail_list_messages",
        "inputs": {
          "query": "is:unread",
          "max_results": "${config.email_count || 10}"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "get_email_details",
        "type": "loop",
        "iterator": "${unread_emails.messages}",
        "body": [
          {
            "id": "fetch_message",
            "type": "tool",
            "tool": "gmail_get_message",
            "inputs": {
              "message_id": "${item.id}"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "classify_and_summarize",
        "type": "llm",
        "inputs": {
          "model": "moonshotai/kimi-k2.5",
          "temperature": 0.3,
          "prompt": "Analyze and prioritize these emails:\n\n${email_details.map(e => `From: ${e.from.email}\nSubject: ${e.subject}\nSnippet: ${e.snippet}\n---\n`).join('')}\n\nFor each email:\n1. Write a one-line summary\n2. Classify urgency: Hot (requires immediate action), Warm (important but not urgent), Cold (can wait)\n3. Identify key action items or decisions needed\n\nThen select the top ${config.top_count || 3} most important emails based on:\n- Sender importance (clients, managers, hot leads)\n- Urgency signals (deadlines, \"urgent\", time-sensitive)\n- Revenue/business impact\n- Action required from you\n\nReturn results sorted by priority (highest first)."
        },
        "outputs": {
          "mode": "json",
          "schema": {
            "json_schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "all_emails": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "from": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "subject": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "summary": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "urgency": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                          "Hot",
                          "Warm",
                          "Cold"
                        ]
                      },
                      "action_items": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "from",
                      "subject",
                      "summary",
                      "urgency",
                      "action_items"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "top_priority": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "from": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "subject": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "summary": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "urgency": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "why_priority": {
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "from",
                      "subject",
                      "summary",
                      "urgency",
                      "why_priority"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "all_emails",
                "top_priority"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "format_results",
        "type": "task",
        "kind": "set",
        "value": {
          "status": "completed",
          "total_unread": "${unread_emails.messages.length}",
          "processed": "${email_details.length}",
          "top_count": "${analysis.top_priority.length}",
          "results": "${analysis}"
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
      {
        "source": "fetch_unread_emails",
        "target": "get_email_details"
      },
      {
        "source": "get_email_details",
        "target": "classify_and_summarize"
      },
      {
        "source": "classify_and_summarize",
        "target": "format_results"
      }
    ]
  }
}
